### Manually map ports with docker compose run --publish/-p

Source: https://github.com/docker/compose/blob/v5.6.1/docs/reference/compose_run.md

Specify manual port mappings with `--publish` or `-p`, just as when using `docker run`, instead of relying on the service's configured ports.

```console
$ docker compose run --publish 8080:80 -p 2022:22 -p 127.0.0.1:2021:21 web python manage.py shell
```

